// What a module's default fold refuses as it is parsed: 'as', 'pub' in either
// place, and the clause written before 'extends'.
//
// Parse stage. Each is a declaration a submodule's designated file writes, since
// a module declares itself once and each needs a module of its own.
//
// The folder holds:
//   renamed/renamed.cone     'as' on a default's name
//   opened/opened.cone       'pub use' on the 'mod' line
//   retired/retired.cone     'use pub' on the 'mod' line
//   backward/backward.cone   the 'use' before 'extends'
